#. ja: ここでは、漁師ギルド運営の大型漁船、<br>「エンデバー号」の乗船受付をしています。<br>ご興味がありましたら、まずは漁師ギルドへどうぞ！
#. de: Bei mir kannst du dich für die große Fahrt auf der <i>Endeavor</i> anmelden. Vorher musst du dich allerdings erst in der Fischergilde melden.
#. fr: Si vous aimez la pêche <i>et</i> la mer, nous sommes <if $gn4>faites<else>faits</if> pour nous entendre<nbsp>! Passez d'abord par la guilde des pêcheurs, et nous pourrons discuter ensemble des détails. À plus tard<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/CtsIkdEntrance_00663:TEXT_CTSIKDENTRANCE_00663_DRYSKTHOTA_000_000:1"
msgid "Welcome to the <i>Endeavor</i>, pride and joy of the Fishermen's Guild. If the thought of embarking on a voyage to the high seas piques your interest, you may be pleased to know we are currently recruiting crew members. Any interested parties are welcome to report to the guild at Limsa Lominsa."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ようこそ！　漁師ギルドが誇る大型漁船……<br>「エンデバー号」への乗船希望ですか？
#. de: Willkommen! Möchtest du mit der <i>Endeavor</i> auf große Fahrt gehen?
#. fr: <if $gn4>Amie<else>Ami</if> de la pêche en mer, <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>bonsoir<else>bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>bonjour<else>bonsoir</if></if><nbsp>! Vous désirez monter à bord de l'Ambition<nbsp>?
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/CtsIkdEntrance_00663:TEXT_CTSIKDENTRANCE_00663_DRYSKTHOTA_000_010:1"
msgid "Welcome to the <i>Endeavor</i>! Will you be boarding the ship?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 乗船受付中
#. de: Anmeldung möglich
#. fr: Embarquement en cours
msgctxt "custom/006/CtsIkdEntrance_00663:TEXT_CTSIKDENTRANCE_00663_SYSTEM_000_005:1"
msgid "Now accepting crew members."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 乗船受付時間外<br>次回の受付開始： <if ($n2 > 0)><num $n2>時間<if ($n3 > 1)><num $n3>分</if>後<else><if ($n3 > 1)><num $n3>分後<else>1分以内</if></if>
#. de: Anmeldung geschlossen<br>Anmeldung öffnet in <if ($n2 > 0)><num $n2> Std <if ($n3 > 1)><num $n3> Min</if><else><if ($n3 > 1)><num $n3> Min<else>unter 1 Min</if></if>.
#. fr: Prochain embarquement dans <if ($n2 > 0)><num $n2> h<if ($n3 > 0)> <num $n3> min</if><else><if ($n3 > 0)><num $n3> min<else>moins d'une minute</if></if>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
